    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which is the most reliable way to assess for clubbing?\n\nOptions: \nA. Inspect the nail-bed angle from the side\nB. Inspect the nail-bed curvature from below\nC. Inspect the nail-bed angle from above\nD. Assessing the nail's texture\nE. Schamroth's sign\nF. Measuring the width of the nail\nG. Checking for pain in the nail-bed\nH. Checking the color of the nail-bed\nI. Measuring the length of the nail\nJ. Assessing the fluctuancy of the nail-bed\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
