    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: On a global scale, trends are suggesting that with rising incomes and urbanization we are seeing a rise in which food commodities?\n\n\nOptions: \nA. Meat and Dairy products\nB. Grains and pulses\nC. Seafood and poultry\nD. Oils and fats\nE. Fruits and vegetables\nF. Nuts and seeds\nG. Beans and lentils\nH. Sugars and sweeteners\nI. Herbs and spices\nJ. Roots and Tubers\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
