    "global index": "MedMCQA_1431",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The probable reasons for a high incidence of dental caries in the teenage population relates most directly to:\n\nOptions: \nA. Rapid growth\nB. Frequency of sucrose intake\nC. Negligence in visiting the dentist\nD. Carelessness in oral hygiene habits\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
