      "generated_answer": "MRI demonstrates intermediate performance compared to EUS (higher sensitivity) and MDCT (higher specificity in N staging), with good specificity for T staging (89%) and no significant improvement when added to others, suggesting it has a viable role in preoperative staging.  \nThe balanced diagnostic metrics indicate MRI is a reasonable alternative where EUS or MDCT are unavailable or contraindicated.  \n\n\\boxed{A}",
