    "global index": "QANTA_Fine Arts_1276",
    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Note to players: composer and type of piece required. The key of an unpublished seventh piece from a set of these pieces can be deduced from the pattern of expanding intervals in alternating directions exhibited by the first six, which have the tonics B- lat, C, A, D, G, and E.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
