      "generated_answer": "The iron lung stops working because the power goes out in the building where Mark lives. This malfunction requires him to be rushed to the hospital, but he survives.\n\n\\boxed{The power goes out in the building}}\n\n## Explanation\n\nThe reasoning process starts by identifying the relevant section of the context: \"One day sometime later, the power goes out in the building in which Mark lives, causing the iron lung to stop functioning.\" This directly states the cause as a power outage. The explanation then confirms no other reasons are mentioned, ensuring the answer is precise and based solely on the provided text, while adhering to the requirement for clarity and brevity within three sentences.",
