      "generated_answer": "William W. Kolderup wins the auction for Spencer Island, purchasing it for four million dollars. He outbids his rival, J. R. Taskinar, who vows revenge. The event sets the stage for the novel's unfolding adventure.\n\n\\boxed{William\\ W.\\ Kolderup}",
