      "generated_answer": "When Frankie and Jeff audition for a comedy spot on air, Frankie performs in blackface as a disguise. During their act, the police arrive searching for Tex Barton. Despite the interruption, they manage to perform, showcasing their comedic talents. \n\n\\boxed{{During their audition, Frankie wears blackface and they perform while the police arrive looking for Tex.}}",
