      "generated_answer": "Bobby and Joseph almost get into a physical altercation because Bobby refuses to cooperate during Joseph's police raid on the El Caribe nightclub aimed at arresting Vadim. This incident significantly strains their already tense brotherly relationship. The context explicitly states that it escalates \"to the point that Bobby and Joseph come to blows.\"\n\n\\boxed{Bobby refuses to cooperate during Joseph's police raid on El Caribe}}",
      "success": true,
