    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The group most opposed to the sentiments expressed in the excerpt above would be: \n\n\\boxed{A}\n\nProgressive Liberals typically advocate for more government intervention and centralized authority to address social inequalities and promote social justice, contrasting sharply with Reagan's belief in limited government and individual freedom, which aligns closely with libertarianism and conservatism as he describes them.",
