    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage challenges the notion that China fell behind Europe simply because it ignored technological progress, instead explaining that China prioritized different military strategies based on its specific threats. It implies that China's choices were pragmatic rather than indicative of a broader rejection of innovation. Thus, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{D}",
