      "generated_answer": "**G**\n\nA sympathetic reader would view Logan as a noble, peace-loving figure wronged by unprovoked violence, prompting support for policies honoring Indian autonomy rather than aggression or forced change. Option G aligns best with this empathy, echoing early calls for treaty-respecting coexistence amid expansionist pressures. Other options like extermination (A), assimilation (J), or removal (D) contradict the address's emphasis on Logan's justified independence.\n\n\\boxed{G}",
