      "generated_answer": "The passage compares how Europe and China developed different military technologies based on their distinct geopolitical threats—Europe facing prolonged sieges and China facing mobile steppe nomads. This highlights how regional challenges influenced technological priorities, particularly in military innovation. The best answer captures this relationship between geography, threats, and technological development.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
